---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="Ma chasse" active="favorites" description="Les cartes que tu veux : leur cours, tes prix cibles et des alertes quand c'est le bon moment.">
  <section class="fv-hero">
    <h1>Ta chasse.</h1>
    <p class="fv-slogan">Les cartes que tu veux. Le bon moment pour les avoir.</p>
    <p class="muted fv-lead">Mets une étoile sur une carte, fixe ton prix cible : HoloDex surveille son cours et te prévient dès qu'elle passe sous ton prix.</p>
  </section>

  <div id="empty" class="empty" hidden>
    <div class="empty-star" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.9l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8-4.3-4.1 5.9-.9z" /></svg></div>
    <h2>Ta chasse commence ici</h2>
    <p class="muted">Touche l'étoile d'une carte dans la recherche, sur sa fiche ou au Marché pour la suivre ici.</p>
    <div class="empty-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`${base}/marche/`}>Parcourir le marché</a>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}/recherche/`}>Chercher une carte</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="goal" id="goal" hidden>
    <div class="goal-main">
      <span class="g-label">Budget pour toute ta chasse</span>
      <span class="g-value" id="g-budget">—</span>
      <span class="g-sub" id="g-budget-sub"></span>
      <div class="g-bar"><span id="g-bar-fill"></span></div>
      <span class="g-sub" id="g-fund"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="goal-side">
      <div class="g-card">
        <span class="g-label">Déjà dans ton classeur</span>
        <span class="g-mid" id="g-owned">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="g-card">
        <span class="g-label">Bonne affaire du moment</span>
        <span class="g-mid" id="g-deal">—</span>
        <span class="g-sub" id="g-deal-sub"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="g-card">
        <span class="g-label">La plus abordable</span>
        <span class="g-mid" id="g-cheap">—</span>
        <span class="g-sub" id="g-cheap-sub"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alerts" id="alertes" hidden>
    <div class="al-head">
      <div>
        <h2>Centre d'alertes</h2>
        <p class="muted small" id="al-status"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="al-actions">
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="al-check">Vérifier maintenant</button>
        <button class="btn" type="button" id="al-notify" hidden>Activer les notifications</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="al-list" class="al-list"></div>
    <details class="al-settings">
      <summary>Réglages des alertes</summary>
      <div class="al-grid">
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="al-on" /><span>Alertes activées</span></label>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="al-th">Prévenir si une carte bouge de</label>
          <select id="al-th">
            <option value="0">Jamais (seulement mes prix cibles)</option>
            <option value="5">± 5 %</option>
            <option value="10">± 10 %</option>
            <option value="20">± 20 %</option>
            <option value="50">± 50 %</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="al-dir">Dans quel sens</label>
          <select id="al-dir">
            <option value="both">Hausse et baisse</option>
            <option value="up">Seulement en hausse</option>
            <option value="down">Seulement en baisse</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted small">Les cours sont vérifiés à chaque visite (au plus toutes les 30 minutes). Les notifications s'affichent tant qu'un onglet HoloDex est ouvert. Aucun e-mail n'est demandé : tout reste dans ton navigateur.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <div class="fv-bar" id="bar" hidden>
    <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filtrer">
      <button type="button" data-f="all" aria-pressed="true">Toutes</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="target" aria-pressed="false">Avec prix cible</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="up" aria-pressed="false">▲ En hausse</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="down" aria-pressed="false">▼ En baisse</button>
    </div>
    <label class="sr-only" for="sort">Trier</label>
    <select id="sort">
      <option value="target">Plus proches de ma cible</option>
      <option value="since">Depuis l'ajout</option>
      <option value="change7">Variation 7 j</option>
      <option value="price">Cours</option>
      <option value="recent">Ajout récent</option>
      <option value="name">Nom</option>
    </select>
  </div>

  <div id="list" class="watch-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <p id="no-match" class="muted" hidden>Aucune carte ne correspond à ce filtre.</p>

  <p class="notice">
    Cours = cote HoloDex (médiane des repères Cardmarket, version normale, toutes langues et tous états confondus). « Depuis l'ajout » compare le cours actuel à celui du jour où tu as suivi la carte.
    Ce n'est pas un conseil d'investissement : avant d'acheter ou de vendre une carte de valeur, parles-en à un adulte.
  </p>

  <script>
    import { getFavorites, removeFavorite, setTargets, onFavoritesChange, type Favorite } from '../lib/favorites';
    import { getCard, priceFor, formatPrice } from '../lib/tcgdex';
    import { toQuote, sparkline, formatChange, changeClass, type Quote } from '../lib/market';
    import { getItems } from '../lib/collection';
    import { conditionFactor } from '../lib/condition';
    import { getSettings, setSettings, checkAlerts, currentAlerts, acknowledge, onAlertsChange, enableNotifications, notificationsSupported, recheckSoon, type PriceAlert } from '../lib/alerts';
    import { el, url, toast } from '../lib/ui';

    interface Row { fav: Favorite; price?: number; low?: number; unit?: 'EUR' | 'USD'; quote?: Quote | null; since?: number; loaded: boolean }

    const $ = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id)!;
    const rows = new Map<string, Row>();
    const key = (f: Pick<Favorite, 'cardId' | 'lang'>) => `${f.lang}:${f.cardId}`;
    const fmt = (v: number, u: 'EUR' | 'USD' = 'EUR') => formatPrice(v, u);
    let filter: 'all' | 'target' | 'up' | 'down' = 'all';
    let editing: string | null = null;

    const pill = (v: number | undefined, prefix: string) =>
      el('span', { class: `pill ${changeClass(v)}` }, [`${prefix}${v === undefined ? '—' : (v > 0 ? '▲ ' : v < 0 ? '▼ ' : '') + formatChange(v)}`]);
    const toTarget = (r: Row) => (r.price && r.fav.targetBelow ? ((r.price - r.fav.targetBelow) / r.price) * 100 : undefined);

    /* ---------- Liste ---------- */
    function render() {
      const favs = getFavorites();
      const has = favs.length > 0;
      $('empty').hidden = has;
      $('bar').hidden = $('goal').hidden = $('alertes').hidden = !has;
      for (const f of favs) {
        const r = rows.get(key(f));
        if (!r) rows.set(key(f), { fav: f, loaded: false }); else r.fav = f;
      }
      for (const k of [...rows.keys()]) if (!favs.some((f) => key(f) === k)) rows.delete(k);
      const trend = (r: Row) => r.quote?.change7 ?? r.since;
      let list = favs.map((f) => rows.get(key(f))!).filter((r) =>
        filter === 'all' || (filter === 'target' ? !!(r.fav.targetBelow || r.fav.targetAbove) : filter === 'up' ? (trend(r) ?? 0) > 0 : (trend(r) ?? 0) < 0));
      const sort = ($('sort') as HTMLSelectElement).value;
      list.sort((a, b) =>
        sort === 'name' ? a.fav.name.localeCompare(b.fav.name, 'fr')
        : sort === 'recent' ? b.fav.addedAt - a.fav.addedAt
        : sort === 'price' ? (b.price ?? -1) - (a.price ?? -1)
        : sort === 'change7' ? (b.quote?.change7 ?? -1e9) - (a.quote?.change7 ?? -1e9)
        : sort === 'since' ? (b.since ?? -1e9) - (a.since ?? -1e9)
        : (toTarget(a) ?? 1e9) - (toTarget(b) ?? 1e9));
      $('no-match').hidden = !(has && !list.length);
      $('list').replaceChildren(...list.map(card));
      renderGoal();
    }

    function card(r: Row): HTMLElement {
      const f = r.fav;
      const k = key(f);
      const href = url(`/carte/?id=${encodeURIComponent(f.cardId)}&lang=${f.lang}`);
      const alerts = currentAlerts().filter((a) => a.cardId === f.cardId && a.lang === f.lang);
      const img = el('a', { class: 'w-img', href, 'aria-hidden': 'true', tabindex: '-1' });
      if (f.image) img.append(el('img', { src: `${f.image}/low.webp`, alt: '', loading: 'lazy', referrerpolicy: 'no-referrer' }));

      const star = el('button', { type: 'button', class: 'fav-btn', 'aria-pressed': 'true', 'aria-label': `Retirer ${f.name} de ta chasse`, title: 'Retirer' });
      star.innerHTML = '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3.5l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.3 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.9l-5.2 2.7 1-5.8-4.3-4.1 5.9-.9z"/></svg>';
      star.addEventListener('click', () => { removeFavorite(f.cardId, f.lang); toast(`${f.name} retirée de ta chasse`); });
      const bell = el('button', { type: 'button', class: `bell-btn ${f.targetBelow || f.targetAbove ? 'set' : ''}`, 'aria-expanded': String(editing === k), 'aria-label': `Prix cibles de ${f.name}`, title: 'Prix cibles' });
      bell.innerHTML = '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 1 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9M10 21h4"/></svg>';
      bell.addEventListener('click', () => { editing = editing === k ? null : k; render(); });

      // Jauge vers le prix cible
      let target: HTMLElement | null = null;
      if (f.targetBelow && r.price !== undefined) {
        const reached = r.price <= f.targetBelow;
        const ratio = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, f.targetBelow / r.price));
        target = el('div', { class: `w-target ${reached ? 'hit' : ''}` }, [
          el('div', { class: 'wt-top' }, [
            el('span', {}, [reached ? 'Prix cible atteint' : `Cible ${fmt(f.targetBelow, r.unit)}`]),
            el('span', {}, [reached ? fmt(f.targetBelow, r.unit) : `encore ${formatChange(-(toTarget(r) ?? 0))}`]),
          ]),
          el('div', { class: 'wt-bar' }, [el('span', { style: `width:${(reached ? 1 : ratio) * 100}%` })]),
        ]);
      }

      const editor = editing === k ? targetEditor(r) : null;
      return el('article', { class: `watch ${alerts.length ? 'alerting' : ''}` }, [
        img,
        el('div', { class: 'w-body' }, [
          el('div', { class: 'w-top' }, [
            el('div', { class: 'w-title' }, [
              el('a', { class: 'w-name', href }, [f.name]),
              el('span', { class: 'w-sub' }, [[f.setName, f.lang.toUpperCase()].filter(Boolean).join(', ')]),
            ]),
            el('div', { class: 'w-btns' }, [bell, star]),
          ]),
          el('div', { class: 'w-price-row' }, [
            el('span', { class: 'w-price' }, [!r.loaded ? '…' : r.price !== undefined ? fmt(r.price, r.unit) : 'Sans cote']),
            r.quote ? sparkline(r.quote.points, 96, 34) : null,
          ]),
          el('div', { class: 'w-pills' }, [
            pill(r.quote?.change7, '7 j '),
            r.since !== undefined ? pill(r.since, 'depuis l\'ajout ') : null,
            ...alerts.map((a) => el('span', { class: 'pill alert-pill' }, [a.kind === 'below' ? 'Cible atteinte' : a.kind === 'above' ? 'Plafond dépassé' : 'Gros mouvement'])),
          ]),
          target,
          f.targetAbove ? el('span', { class: 'w-sub' }, [`Plafond : ${fmt(f.targetAbove, r.unit)}`]) : null,
          editor,
        ]),
      ]);
    }

    function targetEditor(r: Row): HTMLElement {
      const f = r.fav;
      const below = el('input', { type: 'number', min: '0', step: '0.01', inputmode: 'decimal', placeholder: r.price ? (r.price * 0.85).toFixed(2) : 'ex. 20', value: f.targetBelow ? String(f.targetBelow) : '' }) as HTMLInputElement;
      const above = el('input', { type: 'number', min: '0', step: '0.01', inputmode: 'decimal', placeholder: r.price ? (r.price * 1.25).toFixed(2) : 'ex. 60', value: f.targetAbove ? String(f.targetAbove) : '' }) as HTMLInputElement;
      const save = el('button', { type: 'submit', class: 'btn btn-primary' }, ['Enregistrer']);
      const clear = el('button', { type: 'button', class: 'btn' }, ['Aucune cible']);
      const form = el('form', { class: 'w-editor' }, [
        el('label', { class: 'field' }, [el('span', {}, ['Me prévenir si le prix descend à']), el('span', { class: 'money' }, [below, el('span', {}, ['€'])])]),
        el('label', { class: 'field' }, [el('span', {}, ['ou s\'il monte à']), el('span', { class: 'money' }, [above, el('span', {}, ['€'])])]),
        el('div', { class: 'w-ed-actions' }, [save, clear]),
      ]);
      const num = (i: HTMLInputElement) => { const v = parseFloat(i.value.replace(',', '.')); return Number.isFinite(v) && v > 0 ? v : undefined; };
      form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        setTargets(f.cardId, f.lang, { below: num(below), above: num(above) });
        editing = null;
        toast(num(below) || num(above) ? 'Prix cibles enregistrés' : 'Prix cibles retirés');
        recheckSoon();
      });
      clear.addEventListener('click', () => { setTargets(f.cardId, f.lang, {}); editing = null; recheckSoon(); });
      setTimeout(() => below.focus(), 0);
      return form;
    }

    /* ---------- Objectif ---------- */
    let collectionValue = 0;
    function renderGoal() {
      const all = [...rows.values()];
      const owned = new Set(getItems().map((i) => `${i.lang}:${i.cardId}`));
      const wanted = all.filter((r) => !owned.has(key(r.fav)));
      const eurRows = wanted.filter((r) => r.unit === 'EUR' && r.price !== undefined);
      const budget = eurRows.reduce((s, r) => s + r.price!, 0);
      const ownedN = all.length - wanted.length;
      $('g-budget').textContent = all.some((r) => !r.loaded) && !eurRows.length ? '…' : fmt(budget);
      $('g-budget-sub').textContent = `${wanted.length} carte${wanted.length > 1 ? 's' : ''} à trouver, un exemplaire de chaque.`;
      const pctFunded = budget ? Math.min(100, (collectionValue / budget) * 100) : 0;
      ($('g-bar-fill') as HTMLElement).style.width = `${budget ? pctFunded : 0}%`;
      $('g-fund').textContent = collectionValue > 0 && budget > 0
        ? (collectionValue >= budget ? `Ton classeur (${fmt(collectionValue)}) vaut plus que toute ta chasse.` : `Ton classeur (${fmt(collectionValue)}) couvre ${pctFunded.toFixed(0)} % de ta chasse.`)
        : 'Scanne tes cartes : la valeur de ton classeur s\'affichera face à ce budget.';
      $('g-owned').textContent = `${ownedN} sur ${all.length}`;
      // Bonne affaire : cours le plus en dessous de sa moyenne 30 jours.
      const deals = all.filter((r) => r.quote?.avg30 && r.price).map((r) => ({ r, gap: ((r.price! - r.quote!.avg30!) / r.quote!.avg30!) * 100 })).sort((a, b) => a.gap - b.gap);
      const deal = deals[0];
      $('g-deal').textContent = deal && deal.gap < -1 ? deal.r.fav.name : '—';
      $('g-deal-sub').textContent = deal && deal.gap < -1 ? `${formatChange(deal.gap)} sous sa moyenne du mois` : 'Aucune carte sous sa moyenne du mois.';
      const cheap = eurRows.sort((a, b) => a.price! - b.price!)[0];
      $('g-cheap').textContent = cheap ? cheap.fav.name : '—';
      $('g-cheap-sub').textContent = cheap ? fmt(cheap.price!) : '';
    }

    async function loadCollectionValue() {
      const items = getItems();
      const cards = await Promise.all(items.map((i) => getCard(i.cardId, i.lang).catch(() => null)));
      collectionValue = items.reduce((s, it, i) => {
        const p = cards[i] && priceFor(cards[i]!, it.finish);
        return p && p.unit === 'EUR' ? s + p.value * conditionFactor(it.condition) * it.quantity : s;
      }, 0);
      renderGoal();
    }

    async function loadPrices() {
      const todo = [...rows.values()].filter((r) => !r.loaded);
      let i = 0;
      await Promise.all(Array.from({ length: 6 }, async () => {
        while (i < todo.length) {
          const r = todo[i++];
          const c = await getCard(r.fav.cardId, r.fav.lang).catch(() => null);
          if (c) {
            r.quote = toQuote(c, r.fav.lang, 'legend');
            const p = priceFor(c, 'normal');
            if (p) { r.price = p.value; r.unit = p.unit; r.low = p.low; }
            if (r.price !== undefined && r.fav.priceAtAdd && r.fav.unit === r.unit) r.since = ((r.price - r.fav.priceAtAdd) / r.fav.priceAtAdd) * 100;
          }
          r.loaded = true;
        }
      }));
      render();
    }

    /* ---------- Alertes ---------- */
    const alOn = $('al-on') as HTMLInputElement;
    const alTh = $('al-th') as HTMLSelectElement;
    const alDir = $('al-dir') as HTMLSelectElement;
    const s0 = getSettings();
    alOn.checked = s0.enabled; alTh.value = String(s0.threshold); alDir.value = s0.direction;
    const syncDisabled = () => { alTh.disabled = !alOn.checked; alDir.disabled = !alOn.checked || alTh.value === '0'; };
    syncDisabled();
    [alOn, alTh, alDir].forEach((x) => x.addEventListener('change', () => {
      setSettings({ ...getSettings(), enabled: alOn.checked, threshold: Number(alTh.value), direction: alDir.value as 'both' | 'up' | 'down' });
      syncDisabled();
      if (alOn.checked) checkAlerts(true);
    }));
    $('al-check').addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const b = $('al-check') as HTMLButtonElement;
      b.disabled = true; b.textContent = 'Vérification…';
      const res = await checkAlerts(true).catch(() => [] as PriceAlert[]);
      b.disabled = false; b.textContent = 'Vérifier maintenant';
      if (!res.length) toast('Rien à signaler : aucun prix cible atteint');
    });
    const notifyBtn = $('al-notify') as HTMLButtonElement;
    notifyBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const ok = await enableNotifications();
      toast(ok ? 'Notifications activées sur cet appareil' : 'Notifications refusées par le navigateur');
      renderAlerts();
    });

    function renderAlerts() {
      const st = getSettings();
      notifyBtn.hidden = !notificationsSupported() || st.notify || !st.enabled;
      const favs = getFavorites();
      const targets = favs.filter((f) => f.targetBelow || f.targetAbove).length;
      $('al-status').textContent = !st.enabled ? 'Alertes désactivées.'
        : `${targets} prix cible${targets > 1 ? 's' : ''} surveillé${targets > 1 ? 's' : ''}${st.threshold ? `, et toute variation de plus de ${st.threshold} %` : ''}.${st.notify ? ' Notifications activées.' : ''}`;
      const list = currentAlerts();
      const box = $('al-list');
      if (!list.length) {
        box.replaceChildren(el('div', { class: 'al-empty' }, [
          el('span', { class: 'al-ok' }, ['✓']),
          el('span', {}, [targets ? 'Aucune alerte : aucun prix cible atteint pour le moment.' : 'Touche la cloche d\'une carte pour fixer ton prix cible.']),
        ]));
      } else {
        const items = list.map((a) => {
          const seen = el('button', { type: 'button', class: 'btn al-seen' }, ["J'ai vu"]);
          seen.addEventListener('click', () => acknowledge([a]));
          const label = a.kind === 'below' ? 'Prix cible atteint' : a.kind === 'above' ? 'Plafond dépassé' : a.pct > 0 ? 'Forte hausse' : 'Forte baisse';
          const dir = a.kind === 'below' ? 'down' : a.kind === 'above' ? 'up' : a.pct > 0 ? 'up' : 'down';
          const thumb = el('span', { class: 'al-thumb' });
          if (a.image) thumb.append(el('img', { src: `${a.image}/low.webp`, alt: '', loading: 'lazy', referrerpolicy: 'no-referrer' }));
          return el('div', { class: `al-row ${a.kind} ${dir}` }, [
            thumb,
            el('div', { class: 'al-main' }, [
              el('span', { class: 'al-kind' }, [label]),
              el('a', { class: 'al-name', href: url(`/carte/?id=${encodeURIComponent(a.cardId)}&lang=${a.lang}`) }, [a.name]),
              el('span', { class: 'al-detail' }, [a.kind === 'move' ? `${fmt(a.from, a.unit)} → ${fmt(a.to, a.unit)}` : `Cours ${fmt(a.to, a.unit)} · ${a.kind === 'below' ? 'cible' : 'plafond'} ${fmt(a.from, a.unit)}`]),
            ]),
            el('span', { class: `al-pct ${dir}` }, [`${a.pct > 0 ? '+' : ''}${a.pct.toFixed(1).replace('.', ',')} %`]),
            seen,
          ]);
        });
        const all = list.length > 1 ? el('button', { type: 'button', class: 'btn al-all' }, ['Tout marquer comme vu']) : null;
        all?.addEventListener('click', () => acknowledge());
        box.replaceChildren(...items, ...(all ? [all] : []));
      }
    }

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-f]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => {
      filter = b.dataset.f as typeof filter;
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-f]').forEach((x) => x.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(x === b)));
      render();
    }));
    $('sort').addEventListener('change', render);
    onFavoritesChange(() => { render(); loadPrices(); renderAlerts(); });
    onAlertsChange(() => { renderAlerts(); render(); });

    render();
    renderAlerts();
    loadPrices();
    loadCollectionValue();
    checkAlerts().catch(() => {});
  </script>

  <style>
    .fv-hero { padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 56px) 0 26px; }
    .fv-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 11vw, 7.5rem); line-height: 0.88; letter-spacing: -0.05em; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    .fv-slogan { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.8rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--gold), #ffb35a 40%, var(--magenta)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .fv-lead { max-width: 620px; }

    .goal { display: grid; gap: 14px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    @media (min-width: 900px) { .goal { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; } }
    .goal-main {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 30px); border-radius: 26px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(255, 210, 90, 0.16), transparent 55%), var(--surface); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 210, 90, 0.35);
    }
    .goal-side { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .g-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); min-width: 0; }
    .g-label { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
